<section class="legal-page section-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Privacy information</h1><p>Leon’s Code is built to collect only the information needed to provide accounts, learning progress, purchases, and support. This starter policy must be reviewed and completed with the actual business contact, retention periods, processors, and applicable legal requirements before launch.</p><h2>What the platform stores</h2><p>Account details, course enrolment and progress, saved program content, and records needed to verify purchases. Raw card details are not stored by this platform.</p><h2>Your account</h2><p>Contact the service owner to request account information or closure, subject to legitimate financial and record-retention requirements.</p></section>
